docs {
  ### API Endpoint: Get All Installation Checklist Items
  
  This endpoint retrieves a list of all available installation checklists and their associated items. This is likely used to populate a list of tasks for the "Installation" tab on the Single License page.
  
  ---
  
  #### HTTP Method
  
  `GET`
  
  ---
  
  #### Endpoint
  
  `{{baseUrl}}/api/installationchecklists/getallitems`
  
  ---
  
  #### Query Parameters
  
  This endpoint does not require any query parameters.
  
  ---
  
  #### Expected Response Format
  
  The response returns a JSON object containing an array of `installationChecklistGroups`. Each group contains an `installationChecklist` object with its details and a `null` `installationChecklistItems` field in this specific response.
  
  JSON
  
  ```
  {
      "installationChecklistGroups": [
          {
              "installationChecklist": {
                  "installationChecklistId": "62ebb021-058b-451f-9e77-47001576f7c8",
                  "title": "Test Haze Software",
                  "description": null,
                  "seq": 1,
                  "createdDate": "2025-01-10T02:57:17+00:00",
                  "updatedDate": null
              },
              "installationChecklistItems": null
          },
          {
              "installationChecklist": {
                  "installationChecklistId": "e0107168-6a07-4642-bca1-861035786833",
                  "title": "Software Update",
                  "description": null,
                  "seq": 2,
                  "createdDate": "2025-01-10T02:57:31+00:00",
                  "updatedDate": null
              },
              "installationChecklistItems": null
          },
          {
              "installationChecklist": {
                  "installationChecklistId": "51a3e65f-90fc-412a-913d-6dd4f319cb13",
                  "title": "Set Installation Date",
                  "description": null,
                  "seq": 3,
                  "createdDate": "2025-01-10T02:57:56+00:00",
                  "updatedDate": null
              },
              "installationChecklistItems": null
          }
      ]
  }
  
   ```
  
  ---
  
  #### Authentication and Headers
  
  This endpoint requires the necessary authentication headers to be included with the request. The specific authentication method will depend on the API's security requirements.
}
